Chinese motherwort is a versatile herb with a long history of use in TCM. Its primary applications include calming the mind, addressing gynecological issues, and reducing inflammation. Always consult a TCM practitioner or healthcare provider before use, especially if you have underlying health conditions or are taking medications.
