- **c) Prospective**: This study tracks participants' behaviors and outcomes in the future.  
- **d) Cross-sectional**: This study compares prices at a single point in time without tracking changes over time.  

The classifications are as follows:  
a) $\boxed{\text{Retrospective}}$  
b) $\boxed{\text{Prospective}}$  
c) $\boxed{\text{Prospective}}$  
d) $\boxed{\text{Cross-sectional}}$
</GROUND_TRUTH>

