   \DeltaS_g = m_g \times c_p \cdot \DeltaT = 3.43 \, \text{kg} \times 1.005 \, \text{kJ/kgK} \times (1100 - 550) \, \text{K} = 3.43 \times 1.005 \times 550 = 1800.4 \, \text{kJ/K}
